# Excluded from the deploy upload — none of this is needed to build or run.
#
# Leading slashes matter. A bare `supabase` would also match
# src/lib/supabase/, which silently removed the app's entire Supabase layer
# and failed the build with "Can't resolve '@/lib/supabase/auth-roles'".
# Anchor every entry to the project root.
/.git
/docs
/supabase
/README.md
